ETES MELLITUS TIPO:La diabetes mellitus tipo es una condición médica que puede aumentar el riesgo de infección en pacientes que se someten a la gastrostomía endoscópica percutánea.", "GEP:GEP refers to Gastrostomy Enteral Feeding, a medical procedure involving the placement of a tube for nutritional support in patients who cannot eat by mouth.", "BRONCOASPIRATION:Broncoaspiration is a medical event where food or liquid enters the lungs, often leading to pneumonia and respiratory complications in patients receiving enteral nutrition.", "GRANULOMA:Granuloma formation is a complication that can occur in patients with GEP, characterized by an abnormal tissue response to irritation or infection.", "ASPIRATION PNEUMONIA:", "DIARREA INFECCIOSA:La diarrea infecciosa es una complicación que puede ocurrir en pacientes que reciben nutrición enteral, caracterizada por la presencia de heces líquidas causadas por infecciones.", "ESTOMA:El estoma es una abertura creada quirúrgicamente que permite la salida de desechos del cuerpo, y puede estar sujeto a infecciones en pacientes con nutrición enteral.", "HIPOFOFATEMIA:Hipofosfatemia is a condition of low phosphate levels that can occur in patients with inadequate nutritional intake or refeeding syndrome.", "AGITACIÓN PSICOMOTRIZ:A condition characterized by restlessness and inability to remain still, which can occur in patients with decreased consciousness due to medical interventions", "TRASTORNO DEPRESIVO:"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}